{"number":80,"nameArabic":"عبس","nameTransliterated":"'Abasa","nameTranslated":"He Frowned","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":42,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"80:1","textAr":"عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"AAabasa watawalla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The Prophet frowned and turned away"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ترش رو ہوا، اور بے رخی برتی"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"80:2","textAr":"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلۡأَعۡمَىٰ","transliteration":"An jaahu alaAAma","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اِس بات پر کہ وہ اندھا اُس کے پاس آ گیا"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"80:3","textAr":"وَمَا يُدۡرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wama yudreeka laAAallahu yazzakka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But what would make you perceive, [O Muhammad], that perhaps he might be purified"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تمہیں کیا خبر، شاید وہ سدھر جائے"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"80:4","textAr":"أَوۡ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Aw yaththakkaru fatanfaAAahu alththikra","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یا نصیحت پر دھیان دے، اور نصیحت کرنا اس کے لیے نافع ہو؟"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"80:5","textAr":"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰ","transliteration":"Amma mani istaghna","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"As for he who thinks himself without need"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو شخص بے پروائی برتتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"80:6","textAr":"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","transliteration":"Faanta lahu tasadda","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"To him you give attention"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اس کی طرف تو تم توجہ کرتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"80:7","textAr":"وَمَا عَلَيۡكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Wama AAalayka alla yazzakka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"حالانکہ اگر وہ نہ سدھرے تو تم پر اس کی کیا ذمہ داری ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"80:8","textAr":"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسۡعَىٰ","transliteration":"Waamma man jaaka yasAAa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جو خود تمہارے پاس دوڑا آتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"80:9","textAr":"وَهُوَ يَخۡشَىٰ","transliteration":"Wahuwa yakhsha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"While he fears [Allah]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور وہ ڈر رہا ہوتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"80:10","textAr":"فَأَنتَ عَنۡهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","transliteration":"Faanta AAanhu talahha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"From him you are distracted"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اس سے تم بے رخی برتتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"80:11","textAr":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذۡكِرَةٞ","transliteration":"Kalla innaha tathkiratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! Indeed, these verses are a reminder"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، یہ تو ایک نصیحت ہے"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"80:12","textAr":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Faman shaa thakarahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So whoever wills may remember it"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس کا جی چاہے اِسے قبول کرے"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"80:13","textAr":"فِي صُحُفٖ مُّكَرَّمَةٖ","transliteration":"Fee suhufin mukarramatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[It is recorded] in honored sheets"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ ایسے صحیفوں میں درج ہے جو مکرم ہیں"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"80:14","textAr":"مَّرۡفُوعَةٖ مُّطَهَّرَةِۭ","transliteration":"MarfooAAatin mutahharatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Exalted and purified"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"بلند مرتبہ ہیں، پاکیزہ ہیں"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"80:15","textAr":"بِأَيۡدِي سَفَرَةٖ","transliteration":"Biaydee safaratin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"معزز اور نیک کاتبوں کے"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"80:16","textAr":"كِرَامِۭ بَرَرَةٖ","transliteration":"Kiramin bararatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Noble and dutiful"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہاتھوں میں رہتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"80:17","textAr":"قُتِلَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكۡفَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Qutila alinsanu ma akfarahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Cursed is man; how disbelieving is he"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"لعنت ہو انسان پر، کیسا سخت منکر حق ہے یہ"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"80:18","textAr":"مِنۡ أَيِّ شَيۡءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","transliteration":"Min ayyi shayin khalaqahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"From what substance did He create him"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کس چیز سے اللہ نے اِسے پیدا کیا ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"80:19","textAr":"مِن نُّطۡفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Min nutfatin khalaqahu faqaddarahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"نطفہ کی ایک بوند سے اللہ نے اِسے پیدا کیا، پھر اِس کی تقدیر مقرر کی"}]},{"ayah":20,"verseKey":"80:20","textAr":"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma alssabeela yassarahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then He eased the way for him"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اِس کے لیے زندگی کی راہ آسان کی"}]},{"ayah":21,"verseKey":"80:21","textAr":"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقۡبَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma amatahu faaqbarahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اِسے موت دی اور قبر میں پہنچایا"}]},{"ayah":22,"verseKey":"80:22","textAr":"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma itha shaa ansharahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then when He wills, He will resurrect him"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر جب چاہے وہ اِسے دوبارہ اٹھا کھڑا کرے"}]},{"ayah":23,"verseKey":"80:23","textAr":"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقۡضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Kalla lamma yaqdi ma amarahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! Man has not yet accomplished what He commanded him"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، اِس نے وہ فرض ادا نہیں کیا جس کا اللہ نے اِسے حکم دیا تھا"}]},{"ayah":24,"verseKey":"80:24","textAr":"فَلۡيَنظُرِ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"Falyanthuri alinsanu ila taAAamihi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then let mankind look at his food"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر ذرا انسان اپنی خوراک کو دیکھے"}]},{"ayah":25,"verseKey":"80:25","textAr":"أَنَّا صَبَبۡنَا ٱلۡمَآءَ صَبّٗا","transliteration":"Anna sababna almaa sabban","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"How We poured down water in torrents"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم نے خوب پانی لنڈھایا"}]},{"ayah":26,"verseKey":"80:26","textAr":"ثُمَّ شَقَقۡنَا ٱلۡأَرۡضَ شَقّٗا","transliteration":"Thumma shaqaqna alarda shaqqan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر زمین کو عجیب طرح پھاڑا"}]},{"ayah":27,"verseKey":"80:27","textAr":"فَأَنۢبَتۡنَا فِيهَا حَبّٗا","transliteration":"Faanbatna feeha habban","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And caused to grow within it grain"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اُس کے اندر اگائے غلے"}]},{"ayah":28,"verseKey":"80:28","textAr":"وَعِنَبٗا وَقَضۡبٗا","transliteration":"WaAAinaban waqadban","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And grapes and herbage"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور انگور اور ترکاریاں"}]},{"ayah":29,"verseKey":"80:29","textAr":"وَزَيۡتُونٗا وَنَخۡلٗا","transliteration":"Wazaytoonan wanakhlan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And olive and palm trees"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور زیتون اور کھجوریں"}]},{"ayah":30,"verseKey":"80:30","textAr":"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلۡبٗا","transliteration":"Wahadaiqa ghulban","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And gardens of dense shrubbery"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور گھنے باغ"}]},{"ayah":31,"verseKey":"80:31","textAr":"وَفَٰكِهَةٗ وَأَبّٗا","transliteration":"Wafakihatan waabban","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And fruit and grass"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور طرح طرح کے پھل، اور چارے"}]},{"ayah":32,"verseKey":"80:32","textAr":"مَّتَٰعٗا لَّكُمۡ وَلِأَنۡعَٰمِكُمۡ","transliteration":"MataAAan lakum walianAAamikum","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[As] enjoyment for you and your grazing livestock"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تمہارے لیے اور تمہارے مویشیوں کے لیے سامان زیست کے طور پر"}]},{"ayah":33,"verseKey":"80:33","textAr":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","transliteration":"Faitha jaati alssakhkhatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But when there comes the Deafening Blast"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"آخرکار جب وہ کان بہرے کر دینے والی آواز بلند ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":34,"verseKey":"80:34","textAr":"يَوۡمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلۡمَرۡءُ مِنۡ أَخِيهِ","transliteration":"Yawma yafirru almaro min akheehi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"On the Day a man will flee from his brother"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس روز آدمی اپنے بھائی"}]},{"ayah":35,"verseKey":"80:35","textAr":"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","transliteration":"Waommihi waabeehi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And his mother and his father"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اپنی ماں اور اپنے باپ"}]},{"ayah":36,"verseKey":"80:36","textAr":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","transliteration":"Wasahibatihi wabaneehi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And his wife and his children"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اپنی بیوی اور اپنی اولاد سے بھاگے گا"}]},{"ayah":37,"verseKey":"80:37","textAr":"لِكُلِّ ٱمۡرِيٕٖ مِّنۡهُمۡ يَوۡمَئِذٖ شَأۡنٞ يُغۡنِيهِ","transliteration":"Likulli imriin minhum yawmaithin shanun yughneehi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ان میں سے ہر شخص پر اس دن ایسا وقت آ پڑے گا کہ اسے اپنے سوا کسی کا ہوش نہ ہوگا"}]},{"ayah":38,"verseKey":"80:38","textAr":"وُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ مُّسۡفِرَةٞ","transliteration":"Wujoohun yawmaithin musfiratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کچھ چہرے اُس روز دمک رہے ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":39,"verseKey":"80:39","textAr":"ضَاحِكَةٞ مُّسۡتَبۡشِرَةٞ","transliteration":"Dahikatun mustabshiratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Laughing, rejoicing at good news"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہشاش بشاش اور خوش و خرم ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":40,"verseKey":"80:40","textAr":"وَوُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٍ عَلَيۡهَا غَبَرَةٞ","transliteration":"Wawujoohun yawmaithin AAalayha ghabaratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور کچھ چہروں پر اس روز خاک اڑ رہی ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":41,"verseKey":"80:41","textAr":"تَرۡهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","transliteration":"Tarhaquha qataratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Blackness will cover them"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور کلونس چھائی ہوئی ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":42,"verseKey":"80:42","textAr":"أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلۡكَفَرَةُ ٱلۡفَجَرَةُ","transliteration":"Olaika humu alkafaratu alfajaratu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہی کافر و فاجر لوگ ہوں گے"}]}]}